<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns A1 rating to IBM's samurai bonds.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns A1 rating to IBM's samurai bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said in a statement on Tuesday that it had assigned an A1 rating to International Business Machines Corp's (IBM) 50 billion yen worth of dual-currency dollar/yen samurai bonds, which mature in June 2000.</p>
</text>
